<title>THAILAND: Ekkapat Finance to issue debentures.</title>
<headline>Ekkapat Finance to issue debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Ekkapat Finance and Securities Plc said on Thursday it will issue debentures worth up to one billion baht (US$40 million) in local and foreign markets.</p>
<p>In a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand, Ekkapat said details of the debentures issue would be worked out later by its board.</p>
<p>($1.00 = 25 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
